        {
          "id": "18296d85-714b-3477-b1d7-05806d4cde99",
          "content": {
            "id": "18296d85-714b-3477-b1d7-05806d4cde99",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Gov't shutdown could have lasting effects on airlines. Here's why.",
            "description": "<p>The airline industry could see long-term <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://sg.finance.yahoo.com/video/could-push-airlines-tipping-point-173000245.html\">impacts from the government shutdown</a>, Raymond James managing director Savi Syth tells Yahoo Finance. Syth explains that while the government is shut down, there isn't air traffic controller training, another headwind for a workforce that is already in short supply.</p>\n<p>Also catch what Hickory Global Partners president Chris Dane has to say about <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/could-push-airlines-tipping-point-173000245.html\">shutdown pressures airline operators could be faced with</a>, all this coming after <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/delta-reports-strong-q3-earnings-ceo-sees-significant-improvement-in-revenue-outlook-103521470.html\">Delta Air Lines </a>(<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DAL\">DAL</a>) <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/delta-reports-strong-q3-earnings-ceo-sees-significant-improvement-in-revenue-outlook-103521470.html\">topped</a> third quarter earnings estimates.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "The airline industry could see long-term impacts from the government shutdown, Raymond James managing director Savi Syth tells Yahoo Finance. Syth explains that while the government is shut down, there isn't air traffic controller training, another headwind for a workforce that is already in short supply. Also catch what Hickory Global Partners president Chris Dane has to say about shutdown pressures airline operators could be faced with, all this coming after Delta Air Lines (DAL) topped third quarter earnings estimates. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination.",
